ONDETERMINISM as applicable. Required outputs: Hermetic input/replay manifest, paired typed-core byte comparison, generated-input hashes, exception record when applicable and accepted/rejected diagnostics. Dependencies consume versioned facts/receipts from expand/current-evidence-and-remaining-work/expand5-integrate-generated-programs, auth/remaining-tasks-and-evidence/enforce-grant-intersection-attenuation-revocation-phase-and-lifetime, build/remaining-tasks-and-evidence/execute-typed-graph-under-declared-build-effects; they do not require blanket component completion. Implementation status remains Open.",
